    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3557" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Argentŏrātus</span></b> ,
		i, f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the name of a city</i>, now <i>Strasburg in Alsace</i>, <i><span class="en">Amm. 15,
			11</span></i>; cf. Mann. Gall. 270.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Argen-tŏrātensis</span></b> ,
			e, adj., <i>of</i> or <i>pertaining to Argentoratus</i>: 
